Thought: I will parse the provided candidates_json, then iterate through each of the 200 candidate studies and use the  
screen_study tool to generate a structured, per-study screening decision based on the verbatim selection criteria. I    
will collect all decisions, count how many are INCLUDE vs EXCLUDE, and then prepare the review-level JSON in the schema 
