            ### 1. Task outcome (short version):
- Screened 200 candidate records; no duplicates detected.
- Included 3 RCTs that match the protocol: adult HF populations, mHealth-delivered education (web/app/SMS on mobile 
devices) versus usual HF care.
- Excluded 197 records (wrong design/population/comparator or interventions not meeting “mHealth-delivered education” as
defined).
- Returned a single JSON object with exactly 200 study entries (INCLUDE/EXCLUDE only).

