│ the time of hospital discharge for those without contraindications. 18 However, many studies have demonstrated that  │
│ adherence to these evidence-based medications declines to≈ 50% at 1-year follow-up. 19, 20 This observation suggests │
│ that patients either do not understand the benefit to continue taking these medications or do understand the benefit │
